Package: selectrs
Type: Package
Title: Translate CSS Selectors to XPath Expressions (Rust Port of 'selectr')
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Simon", "Potter", email = "simon@sjp.co.nz",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Simon", "Sapin", role = "aut",
           comment = "cssselect, from which the translation semantics derive"),
    person("Ian", "Bicking", role = "aut",
           comment = "cssselect, from which the translation semantics derive"),
    person("The authors of the vendored Rust crates", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS"))
Description: Translates a CSS selector into an equivalent XPath expression.
    A standalone, API-compatible port of the 'selectr' package with the
    parsing and translation core implemented in Rust via the 'css-to-xpath'
    crate. This allows searching XML documents using CSS selectors with the
    same results as 'selectr', but much faster.
